    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n39744" root="نسر" body-key="n">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نُسَارِيَّةٌ</span></b>  The <i>eagle;</i> syn. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عُقَابٌ</span>: (IAar, K:)
likened to the <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نَسْر</span>. (IAar, TA.) [Hence it
appears that, accord. to IAar, the <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نَسْر</span> is not the
eagle.]

